This file is the machine-generated inventory of the third-party crates the application depends on, with the licence each is used under. It is the source list for the notices that accompany release bundles.

Regenerate with:

```
cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY.md
```

(the template lives in [`about.hbs`](about.hbs); requires `cargo install cargo-about --locked --features cli`)

